# Author only Contributors

GitHub **Contributors** for this repo must show **only** the owner:

* Name: `Mohamed Abdelkarim`
* GitHub: `mohabdelkarim`
* Email: `mohaabdelkarim2@gmail.com` (must match existing commits / GitHub account)

## Required

* Use the repo's existing local git `user.name` / `user.email` for every commit
* Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent`, or any AI/bot trailer
* Never commit as `cursoragent`, `Cursor Agent`, `github-actions[bot]`, or similar identities when making local/agent commits
* CI link repair commits must keep `GIT_AUTHOR_*` / `GIT_COMMITTER_*` set to Mohamed Abdelkarim via repo secrets

## Forbidden

* Opening PRs from Cursor bot accounts so a second contributor appears
* Changing global git config to an agent identity
* Amending history solely to inject an agent co-author

# No dash separators in markdown lists

* Use `*` for bullets, not `-`
* Resource format: `* [Name](url): Description.`
* Never write `* [Name](url) - Description.` or `- [Name](url) - Description.`
